} </style><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Audiowide%3A400%2C400italic%2C700%2C700italic"/></head><body class="locale_en jam_layout_widget layout_widget responsive no_theme_toggle" data-host="itch.io" data-page_name="view_jam"><div class="gray jam_layout_header_widget header_widget base_widget small_logo" id="jam_layout_header_9092543"><a href="#maincontent" class="skip_to_main">Skip to main content</a><div class="primary_header"><h1 title="itch.io - indie game hosting marketplace" class="title"><a title="itch.io - indie game hosting marketplace" class="header_logo" href="/"><span class="visually_hidden">itch.io</span><img class="full_logo" width="775" src="https://static.itch.io/images/logo-black-new.svg" height="199" alt="itch.io logo &amp; title"/><img class="minimal_logo" width="262" src="https://static.itch.io/images/itchio-textless-black.svg" height="235" alt="itch.io logo"/></a></h1><div class="header_buttons"><a data-label="browse" class="header_button browse_btn" href="/games">Browse Games</a><a data-label="jams" class="header_button jams_btn" href="/jams">Game Jams</a><a data-label="developers" class="header_button developers_btn" href="/developers"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-upload"></span>Upload Game</a><a data-label="devlogs" class="header_button devlogs_btn" href="/devlogs">Developer Logs</a><a data-label="community.home" class="header_button community.home_btn" href="/community">Community</a></div><form action="/search" class="game_search"><input class="search_input" type="text" name="q" placeholder="Search for games, jams, tags or creators" required="required"/><button aria-label="Search" class="submit_btn"><svg stroke-linecap="round" class="svgicon icon_search" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden role="img" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" version="1.1"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg></button></form><div class="user_panel_widget base_widget" id="user_panel_7078076"><a data-label="log_in" class="panel_button" href="/login" data-register_action="header">Log in</a><a data-label="register" class="panel_button register_button" href="/register" data-register_action="header">Register</a></div></div><div class="header_dropdown" data-target="browse"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default after_voting is_over" id="view_jam_9584225"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img class="jam_banner "/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_3526682"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/furries">Furry Game Jam #2</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://fursudo.itch.io">SUDO</a>, <a href="https://furrygamejam.itch.io">Furry Game Jam</a> · <a href="https://bsky.app/hashtag/FurryGameJam">#FurryGameJam</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box"><a href="/jam/furries/entries"><div class="stat_value">52</div><div class="stat_label">Entries</div></a></div><div class="stat_box"><div class="stat_value">1,581</div><div class="stat_label">Ratings</div></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a data-label="tab_view_jam" class="header_tab active" href="/jam/furries">Overview</a><a data-label="tab_view_jam_entries" class="header_tab" href="/jam/furries/entries">Submissions</a><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/furries/results">Results</a><a data-label="tab_view_jam_feed" class="header_tab" href="/jam/furries/feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget after_voting is_over" id="jam_submitter_401467"><p>This jam is now over. It ran from <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-10 19:00:00</span> to <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-20 19:00:00</span>. <a href="/jam/furries/results">View results</a></p></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><h1 class="text-center">
  Welcome to <span><strong>FurryGameJam 2026</strong></span></h1>
<p>
  This Jam will primarily be coordinated through the
  <strong>FurryGameJam Discord Server</strong>, so be sure to join here:
  <a href="https://discord.gg/8d9HCbKkRd" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Furry Game Jam Discord Server</a>
</p>
<hr>
<h2 class="text-center">
  <strong>What is a Game Jam?</strong>
</h2>
<p>
  A Game Jam is when several developers come together over a short period to
  create a game project. Generally, game jams have restrictions or specific
  direction (themes) to help guide the design and inspire the developers.
</p>
<p>
  Furry Game Jam will last <strong>ten&nbsp;days </strong>and aims to encourage the
  creation of more games within the furry community.
</p>
<hr>
<h2 class="text-center"><strong>Theme</strong></h2>
<h3>📶 SIGNAL</h3>
<p>You may interpret this theme however you would like, but here are a few examples of how <strong>Signal</strong> may be understood:
 </p>
<blockquote> <ul><li>Mechanics around sending/receiving or interpreting signals (e.g.: exploring transmissions such as radio or encoded messages)
</li><li>Using subtle indicators to hint at hidden elements or upcoming events (<em>signaling something</em>)
</li><li>Expressing intent or meaning through actions, patterns, or environmental changes
</li></ul> </blockquote>
<hr>
<h2 class="text-center"><strong>Setup</strong></h2>
<p>
  All communications will be done via the
  <strong>FurryGameJam Discord server</strong>, and a space will be provided to
  join or create a team. You can also participate solo, but teaming up is highly
  recommended!
</p>
<p>
  Here, you can find resources to guide you through making a game, even if this
  is your first time!
</p>
<hr>
<h2 class="text-center"><strong>Voting</strong></h2>
<p>
  The public will be able to vote on submissions based on five categories, those being:</p>
<ul><li>Interpretation of the Theme
</li><li>Art Direction
</li><li>Audio (Music and Sound)
</li><li>Narrative
</li><li>Gameplay
</li></ul>
<p><br></p>
<hr>
<h2 class="text-center"><strong>Rules</strong></h2>
<ul>
  <li>ZERO Tolerance for AI&nbsp;usage - Submissions will be disqualified</li><li>Everyone is welcome to participate! However, we recommend that participants under 18 (minors) refrain from joining. Those aged 16-17 may participate with parental permission. Underage participants must be supervised by a parent or guardian during the jam to ensure a safe experience.
  </li>
  <li>
    All submissions must be SFW (safe for work). Any projects containing sensitive material or topics, such as self-harm or violence,  should include proper content warnings.
  </li><li>
    Submissions must comply with <a href="https://itch.io/docs/legal/terms">itch.io&#x27;s Terms of Service</a>.</li><li>
    Participants may only use assets they have a commercial license for.
  </li>
  <li>
    Your submission must be playable directly in a browser (via WebGL). 
    <ul>
      <li>Note: This rule applies to engines that support WebGL. If you’re using Unreal Engine, you’re exempt from this requirement.</li>
    </ul>
  </li><li>Teams can have a maximum of eight members.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p>
  For more information, visit: <a href="https://furrygamejam.com/?ref=itch" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">https://furrygamejam.com/</a><br>
</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Artwork of Pix provided by&nbsp;<a href="https://www.furaffinity.net/gallery/smooxie/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Smooxie</a></p>
